WEATHER CHATBOT - COMENZI IN ORDINE (PowerShell)

Se folosesc 2 terminale PowerShell.


=== INSTALARE (doar prima data) ===

Terminal 1:

cd "D:\Visual Studio\Laborator SOPM\weather-chatbot"
python -m venv .venv
.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
cd backend
pip install -r requirements.txt
pip install pyinstaller
copy .env.example .env

Terminal 2:

cd "D:\Visual Studio\Laborator SOPM\weather-chatbot\frontend"
npm install


=== PORNIRE IN BROWSER (de fiecare data) ===

Terminal 1 (backend):

cd "D:\Visual Studio\Laborator SOPM\weather-chatbot"
.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
cd backend
uvicorn main:app --reload --port 8000

Terminal 2 (frontend):

cd "D:\Visual Studio\Laborator SOPM\weather-chatbot\frontend"
npm run dev

Deschide in browser: http://localhost:5173


=== APLICATIE DESKTOP (.exe) ===

-> Pentru a genera executabilul final (installer-ul):

1. Pregatirea backend-ului (Terminal 1 - cu venv activat):
   cd backend
   pyinstaller --onefile --windowed run_server.py
   * Copiaza manual fisierul generat din "backend\dist\run_server.exe" in folderul "frontend\extra\"

2. Crearea executabilului (Terminal 2):
   cd "D:\Visual Studio\Laborator SOPM\weather-chatbot\frontend"
   npm run electron:pack

Unde este aplicatia ta?
In folderul "frontend\release\" vei gasi "Weather Chatbot Setup.exe". 
Instaleaza-l sau ruleaza-l (acest executabil porneste automat atat interfata cat si serverul Python, fara sa mai deschizi terminale).


=== OPRIRE ===

Ctrl + C in fiecare terminal (doar pentru varianta de Browser/Dezvoltare).


